{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_139271",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A C<small><sub>21</sub></small>-steroid that is cortisol bearing an additional hydroxy substituent at the 6β-position. In humans, it is produced as a metabolite of cortisol by cytochrome p450-3A4 (CYP3A4, an important enzyme involved in the metabolism of a variety of exogenous and endogenous compounds) and can be used to detect moderate and potent CYP3A4 inhibition in vivo."
  ],
